-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATA PROVENANCE & ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Primary epidemiological, climatic, and demographic source records bundled in
`data/raw/` originate from open public-health and earth-observation repositories
aggregated via the Infodengue-Mosqlimate Dengue Challenge (Zenodo DOI:
10.5281/zenodo.13328231, CC BY 4.0):
  - SINAN / DATASUS (Brazilian Ministry of Health)
  - ECMWF ERA5 Reanalysis
  - IBGE (Instituto Brasileiro de Geografia e Estatistica & REGIC 2018)
Please retain attribution to these primary providers in academic publications.

